/* beatguider */
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-origin-when-cross-origin
Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
/* Long-cache fingerprinted static assets */
/_next/static/:path* public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/* OG + content images */
/:folder(og|gear|articles)/:path* public, max-age=604800
